      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure if problematic, but if we skip the entry here for whatever reason we still keep its `dirMaxWidth` and `dirMaxHeight` contribution.",
      "revId": "fc7c537c08f34d4de19bba4396049e31973b4f3e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
